  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OSCAIR-Community embassy for Assyrians</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An organisation that has developed largly with great success having made a mark with its work on the Christian and Assyrian Communities in Turkey with the project focusing on the Southeastern Anatolian Region of Turkey. Also with a specific focus on Assyrian communities who have migrated from Turkey to European Countries and those in Syria and Iraq. Within the framework of the project the partner also has good political contacts in the region and on an international level to promote the existance of the Assyrian culture and also mediate religious affairs in general in Turkey.</narrative>
  </description>
